    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here’s a quick sketch of what a minimal terminal render might look like for a graph with 3 boxes and edges between them:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
